        "viewKind": "display",
        "semanticLevel": "summary",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        },
        "markdown": "# Lionel Validation Study 07\n\n## Preventive Scenario Monologue\n\nA roughly **21:08** episode centered on Lionel's prediction that the Tyler Robinson case could end before trial, followed by a simulated future news scenario, historical analogy, proposed countermeasures, and a final return to the weapon-evidence question.\n\n**Sequence controller:** `thesis`  \n**Navigation mode:** `mostly-linear`  \n**Media queue:** none  \n**Host:** none  \n**Major new primitive required:** probably none\n\n`WARN -> SIMULATE -> SHOW CONSEQUENCE -> CITE PRECEDENT -> MAP RISK -> PROPOSE RESPONSE -> RETURN TO PROOF -> OUTRO`\n\nThis one mostly fits the grammar we already have.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786060285808,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
