        "markdown": "# 📺 Source and Attribution Boundary\n\n**Duration represented:** approximately 21:08.\n\nLionel opens by predicting that Tyler Robinson may not survive to stand trial and argues that such an event would terminate public interest in unresolved questions surrounding the Charlie Kirk investigation. \n\nThe episode includes serious allegations, predictions of future harm, disputed factual assertions, and historical claims. They remain attributed to Lionel. This study analyzes rhetorical structure rather than verifying those claims.\n\nDescriptions of hypothetical harm are kept structural rather than operational.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786060285808,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
