        "markdown": "# 4 · Vulnerability Map and Disruptor\n## 10:16–12:49\n\nLionel names Tyler, Lance, and Erica as people he worries could be harmed, then describes Candace Owens as the actor who disrupted an earlier equilibrium by refusing to stop asking questions. \n\n**Function:** convert the abstract threat model into an actor field containing vulnerable people, adversarial forces, and a disruptive investigator.\n\nThis fits existing `Actor Field` and `Lionel Maps Actors` concepts from Study 06.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786060285808,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
