        },
        "markdown": "# 8 · Compact Channel Outro\n## 19:26–21:08\n\nLionel thanks viewers for their time, asks for likes, subscriptions, notification settings, and financial support, jokes about the ways viewers might pay him, and finishes with his recurring show-closing phrase. \n\n**Function:** conventional channel maintenance and ritual close.\n\nNo new production primitive is needed.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
