      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-validation-study-07"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🧬 Observed Grammar\n\n**warning thesis -> explain consequence -> simulate future event -> simulate narrative closure -> add historical precedent -> identify vulnerable actors -> identify disruptive actor -> propose reconciliation strategy -> propose protective countermeasure -> rank evidence -> return to proof standard -> channel outro**\n\n## Sequence controller\n`thesis`\n\n## Navigation mode\n`mostly-linear`\n\n## Best composition fit\n`Lionel Thesis Monologue`\n\n### More specific episode mode\n`preventive-risk-scenario`\n\nStudy 07 therefore looks more like a **subtype or configuration of Study 01** than a seventh independent composition template.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786060285808,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study07-validation",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Validation Result",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": -330,
        "y": 520
      },
      "width": 670,
      "height": 590,
      "ports": [
        {
