      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-validation-study-07"
        },
        "markdown": "# ✅ Validation Result\n\nThis specimen is important precisely because **most of it is already explainable**.\n\n## Existing concepts that fit cleanly\n- Thesis Monologue\n- States Thesis\n- Adds Analogy\n- Adds Historical Context\n- Identifies Pattern\n- Maps Actors\n- Audits Evidence\n- Reenacts Proof Test\n- Directs Audience\n- Channel Outro\n\n## Existing structural concepts that fit\n- `sequenceController = thesis`\n- `navigationMode = mostly-linear`\n- Actor Field\n- evidence priority\n- speaker uncertainty\n- attributed claim\n\n## Novelty\nOnly two moves feel meaningfully new:\n\n1. `Runs a Future Scenario`\n2. `Proposes a Countermove`\n\nNeither requires a new episode template.\n\nThat is exactly the diminishing novelty we hoped to see.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786060285808,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study07-newmoves",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Two Candidate Moves",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": 410,
        "y": 520
      },
      "width": 650,
      "height": 570,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
