          "angle": 180
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-validation-study-07"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🔬 Comparison Across Seven Studies\n\n## 01 · Thesis Monologue\nCentral proposition controls sequence.\n\n## 02 · Hosted Forensic Commentary\nEvidence audit operates inside another host's container.\n\n## 03 · Annotated Media Reaction\nOne source timeline controls sequence.\n\n## 04 · Thesis-Led Adversarial Media Audit\nLionel's critique controls sequence and source clips become exhibits.\n\n## 05 · Curated Media Mosaic\nA media queue controls sequence.\n\n## 06 · Live Associative Monologue\nA thematic thread survives repeated branch-and-return navigation.\n\n## 07 · Preventive Scenario Monologue\nA thesis controls a short, mostly linear episode; future simulation and proposed interventions serve the thesis.\n\n## Important result\nStudy 07 **collapses back into an existing family** rather than forcing a new family.\n\nThat is evidence that the grammar is beginning to converge.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786060285808,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study07-compression",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "What Study 07 Says About the Ontology",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": 1960,
        "y": 520
      },
      "width": 700,
      "height": 610,
      "ports": [
