      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-validation-study-07"
        },
        "markdown": "# 📏 Confidence and Next Test\n\n## High confidence\n- Study 07 belongs to the thesis-monologue family\n- the grammar is showing diminishing novelty\n- sequence controller and navigation mode successfully classify the specimen\n- evidence-audit and proof-test moves recur strongly\n- a future scenario can be represented as a rhetorical move rather than a new template\n\n## Medium confidence\n- `Lionel Runs a Future Scenario` deserves a permanent show-specific class\n- `Lionel Proposes a Countermove` deserves a permanent class rather than a role\n\n## What would strengthen the model next\nA transcript that appears radically different from the existing six families is now more informative than another near-duplicate.\n\nIf the next few specimens continue fitting mostly existing machinery, the discovery phase should end and the class-design phase should begin.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786060285808,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    }
